<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="CASH LIVE - Premium yayın platformu">
<title>CASH LIVE | Premium Yayın Platformu</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    background: #050505;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.035;
    background-image:
        linear-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 55px 55px;
    z-index: -1;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.container {
    width: 92%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: auto;
}

/* HEADER */

header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 999;
    padding: 18px 0;
    background: rgba(5,5,5,0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.logo span {
    color: #777;
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
}

.nav-links a {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 13px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
    color: #fff;
}

.nav-button {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
    min-height: 900px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-top: 100px;
}

.hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 750px;
    height: 750px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
        circle,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.13),
        transparent 65%
    );
    top: -380px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 800px;
    height: 800px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-radius: 50%;
    top: 150px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
}

.badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.hero h1 {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: clamp(70px, 13vw, 150px);
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -8px;
    font-weight: 950;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #666;
}

.hero-text {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 35px auto 0;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 35px;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0 25px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.btn-white {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
}

.btn-white:hover {
    background: #dcdcdc;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
}

.btn-dark {
    background: #111;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
}

.btn-dark:hover {
    background: #191919;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
}

/* STATS */

.stats {
    margin-top: 65px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(10,10,10,0.8);
}

.stat {
    padding: 28px 15px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.stat:last-child {
    border-right: none;
}

.stat strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 30px;
}

.stat span {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
}

/* SECTIONS */

section {
    padding: 110px 0;
}

.section-head {
    max-width: 750px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: auto;
}

.section-head small {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.section-head h2 {
    margin-top: 15px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 65px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
}

.section-head p {
    color: #777;
    margin-top: 20px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

/* FEATURES */

.features {
    margin-top: 55px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 15px;
}

.feature {
    min-height: 250px;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,#151515,#080808);
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.feature:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
}

.feature-number {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.feature-icon {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    margin: 25px 0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#777);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 900;
}

.feature h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
}

.feature p {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

/* SHOWCASE */

.showcase {
    margin-top: 55px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 18px;
}

.showcase-main,
.showcase-side {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,#151515,#080808);
}

.showcase-main {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 55px;
    min-height: 470px;
}

.showcase-main::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 450px;
    height: 450px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 50%;
    right: -180px;
    top: -180px;
    box-shadow:
        0 0 0 60px rgba(255,255,255,0.015),
        0 0 0 120px rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
}

.showcase-main small {
    color: #777;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.showcase-main h3 {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(38px,5vw,65px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
}

.showcase-main p {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #777;
}

.tags {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.tag {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 11px;
}

.showcase-side {
    padding: 30px;
}

.info-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}

.info-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
}

.info-row strong {
    font-size: 13px;
}

.info-row span {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: right;
}

/* PRICES */

.switch-area {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 40px 0;
}

.switch {
    display: flex;
    padding: 5px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #0b0b0b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
}

.switch button {
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: #666;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 11px;
}

.switch button.active {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
}

.price-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
    gap: 15px;
}

.price-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 21px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: linear-gradient(150deg,#151515,#090909);
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.price-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
}

.price-card.popular {
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}

.popular {
    position: absolute;
    right: 15px;
    top: 15px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 900;
}

.duration {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.price {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 37px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
}

.price-name {
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.price-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 25px 0;
    min-height: 145px;
}

.price-list li {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 6px 0;
}

.price-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: #fff;
    margin-right: 8px;
}

.price-button {
    display: block;
    padding: 13px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
}

/* DEMO */

.demo-box {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 70px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 80% 50%,
            rgba(255,255,255,0.12),
            transparent 30%
        ),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#151515,#080808);
}

.demo-box h2 {
    font-size: clamp(40px,6vw,75px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -5px;
}

.demo-box p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #777;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.demo-time {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 11px 15px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    background: #0b0b0b;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
}

/* STEPS */

.steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 55px;
}

.step {
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #0c0c0c;
}

.step-number {
    width: 43px;
    height: 43px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 900;
}

.step h3 {
    margin-top: 22px;
}

.step p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

/* FAQ */

.faq {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 50px auto 0;
}

.faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.faq-question {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 23px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.faq-answer {
    display: none;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.faq-item.active .faq-answer {
    display: block;
}

.faq-plus {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 20px;
}

/* CONTACT */

.contact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 50px;
}

.contact-card {
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 23px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,#141414,#080808);
}

.contact-card h3 {
    font-size: 32px;
}

.contact-card p {
    color: #777;
    margin-top: 12px;
}

.phone {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 900;
}

/* FINAL */

.final {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 100px 25px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 0,
            rgba(255,255,255,0.12),
            transparent 45%
        ),
        #0b0b0b;
}

.final h2 {
    font-size: clamp(45px,8vw,90px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -6px;
}

.final p {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    color: #777;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
    padding: 60px 0 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
}

.footer-title {
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.footer-column strong {
    font-size: 12px;
}

.footer-column a {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.footer-column a:hover {
    color: #fff;
}

.footer-description {
    max-width: 300px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.copyright {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    color: #444;
    font-size: 11px;
}

/* WHATSAPP */

.whatsapp {
    position: fixed;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 20px;
    z-index: 1000;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 900;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

/* MOBILE */

@media(max-width:1000px) {

    .features {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .price-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .steps {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .showcase {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
}

@media(max-width:700px) {

    header {
        padding: 15px 0;
    }

    .nav-links {
        display: none;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 850px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 21vw;
        letter-spacing: -5px;
    }

    .hero-text {
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .stats {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .stat:nth-child(2) {
        border-right: none;
    }

    .stat:nth-child(-n+2) {
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .features,
    .price-grid,
    .steps,
    .contact {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .showcase-main {
        padding: 32px;
    }

    .showcase-main h3 {
        font-size: 42px;
    }

    .demo-box {
        padding: 40px 25px;
    }

    .buttons .btn {
        width: 100%;
    }

    .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .copyright {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
    }
}

@media(max-width:450px) {

    section {
        padding: 75px 0;
    }

    .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .price {
        font-size: 34px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="container">

<div class="nav">

<a href="#" class="logo">
CASH <span>LIVE</span>
</a>

<div class="nav-links">

<a href="#platform">Platform</a>
<a href="#features">Özellikler</a>
<a href="#packages">Paketler</a>
<a href="#demo">Demo</a>
<a href="#faq">SSS</a>
<a href="#contact">İletişim</a>

</div>

<a
class="nav-button"
href="https://wa.me/17058067601"
target="_blank">
WHATSAPP
</a>

</div>

</div>

</header>


<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero">

<div class="container">

<div class="hero-content">

<div class="badge">
CASH LIVE • PREMIUM YAYIN PLATFORMU
</div>

<h1>
CASH <span>LIVE</span>
</h1>

<p class="hero-text">
Canlı yayın, film ve dizi deneyimini modern ve premium
bir platform üzerinden keşfedin. Paket seçeneklerini
inceleyin ve detaylı bilgi için bizimle iletişime geçin.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<a
href="#packages"
class="btn btn-white">
PAKETLERİ İNCELE
</a>

<a
href="https://wa.me/17058067601?text=Merhaba%20Cash%20Live%20hakkinda%20bilgi%20almak%20istiyorum."
target="_blank"
class="btn btn-dark">
WHATSAPP'TAN BİLGİ AL
</a>

</div>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<strong>7.829</strong>
<span>Kanallar</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong>39.316</strong>
<span>Filmler</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong>3.670</strong>
<span>Diziler</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<strong>147</strong>
<span>Rehberli Kanallar</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- PLATFORM -->

<section id="platform">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-head">

<small>PLATFORM</small>

<h2>
Tek ekranda daha düzenli deneyim.
</h2>

<p>
Cash Live; kanal, film, dizi ve canlı yayın kategorilerini
modern ve sade bir görünümde sunmak için tasarlanmıştır.
</p>

</div>


<div class="showcase">

<div class="showcase-main">

<small>CASH LIVE EXPERIENCE</small>

<h3>
Yayın deneyimini sadeleştiren premium arayüz.
</h3>

<p>
Geniş içerik yapısı, yüksek görüntü kalitesi ve
kolay iletişim seçenekleri tek bir sayfada.
</p>

<div class="tags">

<div class="tag">4K</div>
<div class="tag">FULL HD</div>
<div class="tag">50–60 FPS</div>
<div class="tag">FİLM</div>
<div class="tag">DİZİ</div>
<div class="tag">CANLI YAYIN</div>
<div class="tag">SPOR</div>

</div>

</div>


<div class="showcase-side">

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Görüntü</strong>
<span>4K / FHD</span>
</div>

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Akıcılık</strong>
<span>50–60 FPS</span>
</div>

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Demo</strong>
<span>6–12 Saat</span>
</div>

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Film</strong>
<span>39.316</span>
</div>

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Dizi</strong>
<span>3.670</span>
</div>

<div class="info-row">
<strong>Kanal</strong>
<span>7.829</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- FEATURES -->

<section id="features">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-head">

<small>ÖZELLİKLER</small>

<h2>
Cash Live deneyimi.
</h2>

<p>
Platform hakkında öne çıkan özellikler.
</p>

</div>


<div class="features">


<div class="feature">

<div class="feature-number">01</div>

<div class="feature-icon">4K</div>

<h3>4K Ultra HD</h3>

<p>
Desteklenen içeriklerde yüksek çözünürlüklü
görüntü deneyimi.
</p>

</div>


<div class="feature">

<div class="feature-number">02</div>

<div class="feature-icon">60</div>

<h3>50–60 FPS</h3>

<p>
Desteklenen yayınlarda daha akıcı görüntü
deneyimi.
</p>

</div>


<div class="feature">

<div class="feature-number">03</div>

<div class="feature-icon">TV</div>

<h3>Canlı Yayın</h3>

<p>
Canlı yayın kategorilerine düzenli erişim.
</p>

</div>


<div class="feature">

